{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41809","headline":"依韵和智谦上人送李相公赴昭武军 · 李中","name":"依韵和智谦上人送李相公赴昭武军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂别庙堂上，雄藩去豁情。\n秋风生鴈渚，晚雾湿龙旌。\n吟里过侯服，梦中归帝城。\n下车军庶乐，千里月华清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}